  headerText: Official Voice of the Regional Directorate
  subheaderText: 'ROUTINE HEALTH CHECKS UNDERWAY: JOIN US FOR THE MUNICIPAL FESTIVAL!'
  descriptionText: Authorities are conducting door-to-door inspections to clear up remaining isolated health incidents. To celebrate regional stability, famous clown Ocho will host tonight's town gathering. "You mourned, cried, and died, now it is time to laugh!" Ocho says.
  footerText: REPORT TO THE CHECKPOINT FOR PROCESSING! DO NOT MIND THE SMELL OR THE DRAINAGE TANK.
